To center a div in CSS, you can use flexbox. Here's the syntax:
```css
div {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}
```
And an example for a class:
```html
<style>
  .centered-div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
```

